%% Runtime Shield — "AI proposes. AEGIS evaluates. Approved actions execute."
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as LLM app / agent
  participant SDK as AEGIS SDK / gateway hook
  participant PE as Policy engine (versioned policy)
  participant HA as Human approver
  participant Tool as Tool / API / data store
  participant Log as Immutable audit log
  App->>SDK: Proposed action (prompt, tool call + params, identity)
  SDK->>PE: evaluate(request, policy vX.Y)
  PE->>PE: Kill switch? (contain → DENY all in scope)
  PE->>PE: Identity claims · tool allow/deny-list · least-privilege scopes
  PE->>PE: Parameter validation · PII redaction · injection / jailbreak detection
  PE->>PE: Rate, token & budget limits
  PE->>PE: Apply rollout mode (observe · warn · protect · enforce · contain)
  PE-->>Log: Decision + reasons + matched rules + citations (redacted)
  alt ALLOW / REDACT / TRANSFORM
    PE-->>SDK: Effective decision (+ redacted / transformed payload)
    SDK->>Tool: Execute
  else REQUIRE_HUMAN_APPROVAL / ESCALATE
    PE-->>SDK: Pending
    SDK->>HA: Approval request (context, risk, policy rule)
    HA-->>SDK: Approve / reject (identity recorded)
    SDK-->>Log: Approval record
    SDK->>Tool: Execute only if approved
  else DENY / RATE_LIMIT
    PE-->>SDK: Blocked or deferred with reason
    SDK-->>App: Safe error + escalation path
  end
